Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.24,0:00:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right. Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.38,0:00:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I felt like someone's eyes have been on\Nme all morning watching my every move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.82,0:00:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.46,0:00:40.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody could have followed\Nme all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.94,0:00:42.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out in the middle of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:46.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't shake the\Nfeeling that someone's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:48.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.48,0:00:52.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be the heat playing\Ntricks with my mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.12,0:00:55.16,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=39}{\blur1.3\bord10\fscx120\fscy100\alpha&H00&\frz0.001099\pos(1391,394)\c&H000000&}Stab
