Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, aren't you a sharp one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.46,0:01:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You somehow sensed my presence?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.28,0:01:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I was engaging\Nmy skills of stealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.30,0:01:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.54,0:01:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even while bats can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.62,0:01:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no business with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm not following.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the business of capturing, see?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our army would like to ask you\Nsome questions about Strazo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.76,0:01:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straitzo, why would you\Nbe interested in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.46,0:01:26.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who is our army?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.28,0:01:40.75,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shijima no soko kara
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.28,0:01:40.75,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,From out of the stillness
