Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.37,0:01:44.58,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Mezameru sono hashira tachi
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.37,0:01:44.58,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The Pillars of the past are awakening
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.96,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Toki wo koe
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.58,0:01:47.96,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,To the dawn of a new day
Dialogue: 3,0:01:47.96,0:01:55.22,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Shinku no chishio ga
Dialogue: 1,0:01:47.96,0:01:55.22,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The river of crimson blood within you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.97,0:02:01.77,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.97,0:02:01.77,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Carries with it the courage to stand and fight
Dialogue: 1,0:01:55.97,0:02:01.77,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tachiagaru yuuki wo hikiawaseru
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.77,0:02:10.49,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Uketsugu ai wo sadame to yobu nara
Dialogue: 1,0:02:02.77,0:02:10.49,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Even if the love I feel is just part of my legacy...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:16.57,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Hohoemu me de tsugi no te wo
Dialogue: 1,0:02:10.49,0:02:16.57,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,I'll still be smiling as I stay one step ahead
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.37,0:02:23.21,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yami wo azamuite setsuna wo kawashite
Dialogue: 1,0:02:18.37,0:02:23.21,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Defying the darkness and dodging death at every turn
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.21,0:02:27.04,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Yaiba surinuke yatsura no suki wo tsuke
Dialogue: 1,0:02:23.21,0:02:27.04,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Slipping past the knife's edge and striking when you least expect
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.04,0:02:32.47,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Tsuranuita omoi ga mirai wo hiraku
Dialogue: 1,0:02:27.04,0:02:32.47,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,The emotions running through me blaze a path to the future...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.30,0:02:35.55,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:34.30,0:02:35.55,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody stone
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.80,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Atsuku like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.80,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Burning like a bloody storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.80,0:02:41.64,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ketsumyaku ni kizamareta innen ni
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.80,0:02:41.64,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,When the time comes to end the vendetta carried by our blood
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.64,0:02:47.44,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Ukiagaru kienai hokori no kizuna
Dialogue: 1,0:02:41.64,0:02:47.44,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,Remember that the bonds of pride will carry you through any storm
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.44,0:02:52.49,Lyrics OP2 Jap,,0,0,0,,Nigirishimete
Dialogue: 1,0:02:47.44,0:02:52.49,Lyrics OP2 Eng,,0,0,0,,So hold them close
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.49,0:03:02.50,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fscx85\fad(0,700)\pos(1431,865)\blur1}Episode 12: "The Pillar Man"
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.49,0:03:02.50,Title2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)\pos(1421,865)}Episode 12: "Pillar Man"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:03:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By your accent, the cut of your face,\Nand your smell, I'd guess you're German.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.50,0:03:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.14,0:03:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What business a thug like you has with\Neither Straight So or Speed Wagon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.66,0:03:09.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you're not Gonna say anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't mind having to beat\Nsome answers out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.34,0:03:14.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you can take On the blade of SS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commander Jonoban with\Njust your bare hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost insulted, but since you\Ninsist, I'm happy to oblige! Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.96,0:03:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how about I give you back\Nyour flea-ridden magic rag?
