Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.26,0:03:37.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cactus needles!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.52,0:03:46.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.88,0:03:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really thought that you were going\Nto give me more of a challenge there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.52,0:03:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.42,0:03:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Repeat after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.86,0:03:57.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never should have challenged\Nyour superior power, Hear Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.86,0:03:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never should have challenged\Nyour superior power. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.04,0:04:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I underestimated your etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.20,0:04:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are quite the\Ngentleman for letting me rest
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right here and giving me these\Nmoments to recover safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.84,0:04:15.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.24,0:04:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recover safely?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.78,0:04:19.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you lost your mind, little boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:21.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, what's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:22.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up for this cactus?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.78,0:04:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should take a closer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That cactus was my goal\Nall along, Hear Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:42.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cacti are made up of nearly 95 % water,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're known to be\Nfabulous conductors of Hamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.60,0:04:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, repeat after me, Hear Donovan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to tell Joseph\NJoestar everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.78,0:04:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.02,0:04:59.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When Speedwagon's body disappeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swore to myself that I would\Nnever give up hope, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turns out he was safe all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, it's nice to hear some\Ngood news for a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to tell Granny Iran.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll be so happy to hear about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.34,0:05:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although, there's no way of telling how the\NGermans have actually been treating him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.24,0:05:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.26,0:05:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bring him home, and Granny Irina's\Nsmile will shine like the midday sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.38,0:05:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave him!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.60,0:05:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Major von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:45.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pittal shell is starting to crack!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.72,0:05:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's currently holding the\Nblood of five prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.80,0:05:51.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still don't know what\Nits full capabilities are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:55.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feeding it anymore could push it\Nbeyond our established safety zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:06:00.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious how the blood was\Nextracted in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, I don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can imagine what sort of\Nthings you came up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.30,0:06:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Speedwagon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.12,0:06:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to look so pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.08,0:06:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you from the start\Nthere was nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop being so arrogant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.26,0:06:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've no idea what he's capable of!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.62,0:06:27.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.42,0:06:30.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That test chamber is impenetrable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has iron walls nearly 20 inches thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.92,0:06:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's equipped with flamethrowers, machine\Nguns, and explosives if we need them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.18,0:06:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't be surprised\Nthat all of your courage
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:45.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't even add up to what\NI have in my little finger,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to know what I think, Speedwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.54,0:06:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that thing is simply a statue of
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.82,0:06:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,petrified caveman bones\Nthat's wasting my time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.22,0:06:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Danger! He's erupting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.12,0:07:02.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That blood it took in is\Nspraying out everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.10,0:07:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activate the sprinkler system!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.66,0:07:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His outer layer is transforming!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.84,0:07:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's morphing into flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.92,0:07:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.70,0:07:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he'll need a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something better than the Pillar Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:57.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As his new godfather, I suppose\Nthis task falls onto me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:58.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll name him after the Mexican winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:03.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He shall be known as San Viento.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:09.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's trying to stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.06,0:08:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rise up and show us what you are made of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.54,0:08:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.42,0:08:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento might have a future.\NThey're doing comedy in the cabaret.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.26,0:09:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ultimate organism, and\Nmore like the ultimate idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think there, Speedwagon?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.44,0:09:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got the brains of a feral animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to smell his way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.14,0:09:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's really just a primitive man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a farce.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Regardless, let's just move on\Nand assume he made the masks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.04,0:09:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, start the experiment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody open the door to\Nthe next chamber. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.32,0:09:40.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.23,0:09:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to be? A prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, a prisoner with a mask, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:50.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only a few days ago,\Nthat thing was a feeble,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.02,0:09:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,toothless old man\Nknocking on death's door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.74,0:09:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We still haven't fed him\Ntoday, so he must be thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he'll go straight for the attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.84,0:10:00.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who will win?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hardly wait.
