Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.60,0:10:08.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? That's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't even put up a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.72,0:10:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an ordinary man after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any other subjects\Nfor this test, Major von Stroheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.88,0:10:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We planted explosives in the prisoner's\Nhead for this exact situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.62,0:10:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give us the word and we'll\Nactivate them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.40,0:10:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major? Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.64,0:10:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.20,0:10:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I rescind the order! His jaw! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.08,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening there with his jaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.04,0:10:44.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.16,0:10:45.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on with his arms?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.44,0:10:50.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd given him up for dead\Nin the beginning, but look!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:53.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento is somehow\Nabsorbing the prisoner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's pulling him straight into his body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.28,0:11:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's devouring him!
