Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.18,0:11:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a marvelous creature!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.78,0:11:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The masked man was no\Nmore than fodder for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.10,0:11:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento feeds with his entire body.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So nothing is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.92,0:11:22.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can absorb every bit of his prey's\Nlife force down to the last drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.86,0:11:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He actually ate the masked man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.50,0:11:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.24,0:11:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, now look.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's grown something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.30,0:11:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as he's still in that\Nchamber, he can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just gained a little\Nweight after his feeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.76,0:11:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.46,0:11:43.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.86,0:11:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what about his intelligence?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What level of thought\Nis he capable of? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:58.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me, Major von Stroheim. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:12:02.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how did he, he said,\Nhow did he know my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.42,0:12:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not even supposed to be able\Nto hear anything from in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.12,0:12:18.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.58,0:12:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to my dangling\Ncactus pal Donoban,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.32,0:12:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the underground facility I'm looking\Nfor is hidden down there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.22,0:12:28.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he was telling the truth,\NSpeedwagon should be inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So now, where am I\Nsupposed to get in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vegetables, canned\Ngoods, meat, thyme, eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.30,0:12:39.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got a nice\Nbasket of food there, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, it's time for the frisking.
