Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.00,0:12:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can give me a little smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.78,0:12:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lift up your skirts and smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.60,0:13:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're cleared to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.48,0:13:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,NEXT!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.58,0:13:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I've got under my skirt\Nis more tequila, big boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.92,0:13:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it alright to bring that through too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.58,0:13:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands up in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any funny moves and we'll shoot you dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.38,0:13:18.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.29,0:13:19.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put your guns down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.36,0:13:21.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a funny move there!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,FIRE!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:24.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.24,0:13:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.40,0:13:28.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not moving it, but I've\Ngot my hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.46,0:13:29.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.56,0:13:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You Germans are so smart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.70,0:13:34.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw through my disguise\Nalmost immediately. Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.88,0:13:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course we saw through that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.60,0:13:39.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're disgusting. Even\Nmy big sister isn't as
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.46,0:13:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ugly as you when we used\Nher to plant the fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:44.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was an ox you should\Nhave spent more time
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.36,0:13:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in front of the mirror\Nthis morning big sissy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.56,0:13:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.06,0:14:04.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was disappointingly easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.14,0:14:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can get this thing to fit,\Nthis uniform should work nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.21,0:14:12.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.14,0:14:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.78,0:14:14.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.02,0:14:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Virtue watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.34,0:14:19.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major von Stroheim, I only\Nlooked away for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.34,0:14:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, you were here as well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.02,0:14:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody here was watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.72,0:14:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just happens that nobody saw anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.88,0:14:33.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put that coffee down!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:37.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was only for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.06,0:14:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I took my eyes off him\Nfor just a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.86,0:14:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.16,0:14:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes no sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.54,0:14:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, my vision is perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.94,0:14:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all have a clear view, but\Nwe don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.70,0:14:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chamber is completely sealed, and\Nstill the subject managed to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.54,0:14:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of the walls show any sign of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.70,0:15:00.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.28,0:15:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want him found keep in mind\Nthat he may have concealed himself
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.72,0:15:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somewhere inside the chamber simply\Ncut off the oxygen supply in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll turn up when he\Nfinds out he can't breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The recorded film is now ready for\Nyour viewing major von Stroheim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for set it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.78,0:15:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.44,0:15:20.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roll the film
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.98,0:15:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's running towards the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.86,0:15:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but why?
