Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.74,0:15:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was he lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:53.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's squeezing himself\Ninto the ventilation ducts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.70,0:15:56.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those sluts are less than two inches tall!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.34,0:16:01.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell could anyone possibly stop\Nan entire body to a cap that small?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.28,0:16:05.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't simply dislocate his joints.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He somehow disassembled\Nhis entire skeleton so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.88,0:16:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that he could completely\Nalter his shape at will!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.78,0:16:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what this means.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.40,0:16:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is now wandering around freely somewhere\Nin your face's ventilation system.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.50,0:16:31.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento already know your\Nname somehow, Major von Stroheim,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.82,0:16:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I think I might know how.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way that would be possible is\Nif he heard your name through the vents.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.14,0:16:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The vents lead directly into this room?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.02,0:16:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You, soldier, turn around and move\Naway from that vent immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:48.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.44,0:17:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's San Viento!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Major Von Stroheim!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.86,0:17:11.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did everybody go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.48,0:17:13.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is it so dark in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.54,0:17:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't I see anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody please help me! I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.06,0:17:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.52,0:17:23.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,San Viento is trying to take\Ncontrol of that soldier's body!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.40,0:17:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone, anyone, please\Ndon't leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't abandon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.56,0:17:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't leave me here with him inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't fully understand\Nwhat's happening here,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I feel like I'm practically\Nbursting with new life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If this thing escapes,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.82,0:17:52.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be known for creating the\NFatherland's most powerful enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.28,0:17:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must destroy him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:56.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this point, it's either him or us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.88,0:17:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, take him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:01.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open fire and shred\Nthat monster to pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.54,0:18:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop the Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.48,0:18:15.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.39,0:18:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.28,0:18:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bullets!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.19,0:18:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have no effect on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:26.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an abomination!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:35.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:37.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he pointing at us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.50,0:18:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.72,0:18:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see he's imitating\None of your machine guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.50,0:18:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's just copying what he's seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.70,0:18:46.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, when he spoke earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.62,0:18:51.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he only said my name, but did not understand\Nit, which means he's not intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.28,0:18:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just apes what he sees.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Undsat gives me a great idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he's only capable of\Nacting like a monkey,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.36,0:19:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we should start preparations\Nfor using him like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.68,0:19:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which one of you was fool\Nenough to disturb my slumber?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.06,0:19:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's clearly capable of higher thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he possesses a great intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just learned our language.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.36,0:19:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand that he\Ndid that in almost no time?
