Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must have been one of our bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's shooting at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.34,0:19:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:44.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get you to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling how many more bullets\Nthat monster might have inside of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.80,0:19:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last thing I need right now\Nis help from a German flunky!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:55.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.58,0:19:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.06,0:20:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see that you're\Nstill just as stubborn as ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody do something! Open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:25.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll need a bit of your hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.08,0:20:28.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a small handful or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.90,0:20:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.17,0:20:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more you fight, the more it'll hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.22,0:20:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're assaulting a superior officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:37.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:40.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that demeanor, but it couldn't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.44,0:20:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call this one the old Hamon Heretic!
