Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.60,0:20:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What that means, that means you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.92,0:20:58.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.42,0:21:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrier up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to lose your hair\Nif you're not careful, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.78,0:21:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,German Army Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.72,0:21:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That felt like sandpaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should consider investing\Nin a decent moisturizer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.62,0:21:36.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how long have you been here, Joseph?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.58,0:21:38.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh, just got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.46,0:21:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.18,0:21:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry I took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.48,0:21:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd have been here sooner if I'd\Nknown what kind of party was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.12,0:22:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be the roundabout.\NThe words will make
